  "cat": "list",
  "body": "That said, there are ways to make long emails feel shorter. One is to make them ridiculously fun. For example, some of my wilder, fantastical story-based emails where I paint hilarious or ridiculous stories end up running over 1,000 words ... but they feel very quick because they are entertaining and change a lot. People can read a lot more when they're having fun."
