  "body": "The single most important \"character\" to develop is your own. And so, I apply a rule to every email I write: \"Will someone know me better after reading this?\" Note that this does not mean they LIKE me more. Many things about me are unlikeable for some — my humour, my kid stories, my obnoxious references to being Christian, my anti-woke views, etc. But they're all ME. That's why every email of mine has at least some quip, or story, or opinion on something: I ALWAYS want you to leave an email knowing \"Daniel Throssell\" better."
