  "cat": "persona",
  "body": "A sneaky trick I use to reinforce my status to my list is to paint myself as a character in stories who is some form of an authority figure over them. So I will (jokingly, of course) make myself a teacher while they're a student; a general when they're a soldier; a kidnapper when they're the prisoner; and so on. Admittedly this is weird, and it probably won't work for people who don't have my personality and style. Maybe it won't work for anyone who isn't me. But at least now you know why I seem like such a psycho."
